# --- checkpoints ---------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub rejects any single file >100MB, so archives over ~75MB are committed
# as `_part_NN` chunks (see checkpoints/*/regroup.sh to reassemble).
# Ignore the reassembled wholes (regenerable from the parts) and the raw
# full-build impl archive (3GB of Vivado artifacts; the lean reports archive
# carries everything needed to re-extract metrics).
checkpoints/*/impl60_designs.tar.gz
checkpoints/*/csynth_conv_lean.tar.gz
checkpoints/*/csynth_llm_lean.tar.gz
checkpoints/*/*.log
